{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "782a87527fbfde9384609ad4f74904aa83f8e645f4c3fd529bdd9c6c4e586c09", "ja": "（今日は『マリオネットの心』のPV撮影だ。\n撮影は順調だが、美希の表情が少し暗いような……）", "zh": "（今天是《木偶的心》的PV拍摄日。拍摄进行得很顺利，不过，美希的表情好像有些阴沉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ccbd0c67abaf24283603a129316d9dbf7aba5be10450e26700adde4bdd43dc9a", "ja": "美希、お疲れ様。\nなんだか元気がないみたいだけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "美希，辛苦了。感觉你好像没什么精神，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "1db3bef58638178d6c64fc1252701d5983a08c609a866b2a50ad151527276ee4", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nミキなら、大丈夫だよ……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n美希没事的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bab64f56ef72136df27f74ea871c1769544a3224716208289c4a058e910d0f74", "ja": "……本当に、大丈夫なのか？\nもし悩んでることがあるなら……。", "zh": "……真的没事吗？\n如果有什么烦恼的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "42b1cd24efc9dfe03f375cd3bcc035be09ae7ddc29ddc32d4394f860736744d9", "ja": "ううん、悩みとかそういうのじゃなくて。\n撮影してる時に、ちょっと考えちゃったの……。", "zh": "没有啦，不是烦恼之类的。\n只是拍摄的时候，忍不住想了点事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "c8a9386cc05dc3aa35357e1879ed850b90ce854460fa6b7d96575c22828adca5", "ja": "ミキが演じてるお人形さん、すごくかわいそうで……\nなんか、悲しい気分になっちゃった。", "zh": "美希饰演的人偶，感觉好可怜……\n不知不觉就觉得有些难过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c3482f7932a22d3f08517211abd096a78519f70e9a11ae61604bf605cddc5c4d", "ja": "なるほど。\n曲の世界観に感情移入しちゃったのか。", "zh": "原来如此。你是对歌曲的世界观产生共鸣了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "65348fe4222e24395655618e671e457ade628dde5110c872dff25a75ef6c3170", "ja": "うん……。すっごく好きなのに、好きって気持ちが\n届かないなんて……ミキだったら耐えられないの。", "zh": "嗯……明明那么喜欢，却连喜欢的心情都无法传达给对方……换作是美希，我可受不了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "bab6f93a7947e87e456fb1359120a8bb4b6d787cfadf578054d650f2bf45d942", "ja": "でも失恋が怖くて、動けないんだよね？\nううっ……考えただけで、胸がギューってなるの。", "zh": "可是你害怕失恋，所以才不敢行动，对吧？\n呜呜……光是想想，胸口就紧得难受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c1ba00085f5310aa6927cbaf61e410ba329e4502af3078419819c4b1a27fc853", "ja": "そうか……。そんな風に思えるくらい、\n美希はこの曲と向き合ったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……美希认真面对了这首歌，才能有这样的感受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "0f25092b1bd13259c897dae1064fdc3206a193daccd91471b000820c154da687", "ja": "うん……。ねえ、{$P$}？\n{$P$}に、ミキの気持ち届いてる？", "zh": "嗯……。那个，{$P$}？\nミキ的心情有传达给{$P$}吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1011_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "61f84269229345e0d5200879432e8632244ed3aa5af6a62f2f738c5d3ed49d33", "ja": "ミキ、いつも伝えてるんだよ？\n{$P$}のこと、大好きって。", "zh": "美希一直都有告诉你哦？\n我最喜欢{$P$}了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "697296caa06cfdf487509e5eb985da8da892c93c4baf389000624757ff2e19ba", "ja": "{$P$}は……\nううん、ハニーは、ミキの気持ち気づいてくれてる？", "zh": "{$P$}有没有……\n不对，Honey，察觉到美希的心意了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_1014", "source_sha256": "1e56b98b59daa75a41bf49679014e764df9f5fad4f4f172cc932b26de1ee3c77", "ja": "もちろんだ！", "zh": "当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_2000_p", "source_sha256": "47426e3db8d552ef09817469f5b6887a90b0bae1c32ddca3c2c0adb6ad380e87", "ja": "もちろんだよ。美希のプロデューサーとして、\nどんな時も美希のことを理解してると思ってる。", "zh": "当然了。作为美希的制作人，\n我觉得自己无论何时都是了解美希的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "ce70295acc5c763b04683c95cfdc6ab2c106a42cf4b58f56ecf3aef7ece02ee3", "ja": "むー……。プロデューサーなら満点だけど、\nハニーとしては、ちょっと残念なの。", "zh": "唔……作为制作人的话可以打满分，但作为亲爱的来说，还是有点遗憾呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_2003_p", "source_sha256": "068dad8df4dab7c1e7c11c92059c497d6c57d0d065afde7937cfddbcf3663fb2", "ja": "み、美希？", "zh": "美、美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_2004_003mik", "source_sha256": "05b04362648a55696f78c796bb2c6d5ffd594da3a00b619b96cc3528bb209cdf", "ja": "ミキの気持ち、ちょっとしか届いてないみたい……。\nでも安心していーよ！　ミキ、人形じゃないもん。", "zh": "看来美希的心情，只传达给你一点点……  \n不过你可以放心啦！美希才不是人偶呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_2005_003mik", "source_sha256": "f81be2253654331aa3b7cbea8174979b4ba9d887b776b4639e07b7405962f64d", "ja": "待ってるだけなんて、つまらないでしょ？\nだからこれからも、いーっぱい大好きって伝えるね♪", "zh": "只是光等着，那多无聊呀？\n所以今后美希也会把好多好多的喜欢传达给你哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0274_2006_p", "source_sha256": "e2cdac5fc0a68fb95dca90a28db866c6d0f5840a856cc438436de1457bfdcc0a", "ja": "（撮影は無事終了した……。それからというもの、\n美希によく話しかけられるようになった……気がする）", "zh": "（拍摄顺利结束了……从那以后，总觉得美希经常主动来找我说话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
